{"id":"97331c72a05275ec","group":"16","path":"16/16-prop-fhodtt-kind-reflection.md","title":"由和与单位构造 Type 到 Kind 的反射","display":"prop-fhodtt-kind-reflection — 由和与单位构造 Type 到 Kind 的反射","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","chapter":"11","label":"16-prop-fhodtt-kind-reflection","aliases":["16-prop-fhodtt-kind-reflection"],"display":"prop-fhodtt-kind-reflection — 由和与单位构造 Type 到 Kind 的反射","depends_on":["[[16-df-category]]","[[16-df-functor]]","[[16-df-adjoint-functors]]","[[16-df-fhodtt-syntax]]","[[16-df-fhodtt-terms]]"],"source":"Propositions 11.5.2–11.5.3, pp. 689–691 (PDF 709–711)","review_status":"source-proposition-reconstructed","revision_date":"2026-10-20"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"chapter","html":"11"},{"key":"label","html":"16-prop-fhodtt-kind-reflection"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-prop-fhodtt-kind-reflection</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-fhodtt-kind-reflection — 由和与单位构造 Type 到 Kind 的反射"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"25a281534aa42440\" href=\"?note=25a281534aa42440\" title=\"16-df-category\">16-df-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fc49efccd7348d66\" href=\"?note=fc49efccd7348d66\" title=\"16-df-functor\">16-df-functor</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a88937ea87ff8530\" href=\"?note=a88937ea87ff8530\" title=\"16-df-adjoint-functors\">16-df-adjoint-functors</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ca2d757f82798122\" href=\"?note=ca2d757f82798122\" title=\"16-df-fhodtt-syntax\">16-df-fhodtt-syntax</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"3930e297a315728a\" href=\"?note=3930e297a315728a\" title=\"16-df-fhodtt-terms\">16-df-fhodtt-terms</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Propositions 11.5.2–11.5.3, pp. 689–691 (PDF 709–711)"},{"key":"review_status","html":"source-proposition-reconstructed"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-20"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ca2d757f82798122\" href=\"?note=ca2d757f82798122\" title=\"16-df-fhodtt-syntax\">16-df-fhodtt-syntax</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"3930e297a315728a\" href=\"?note=3930e297a315728a\" title=\"16-df-fhodtt-terms\">16-df-fhodtt-terms</a> 的混合语境、表达式集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Expr}\">\\(\\mathsf{Expr}\\)</span> 与有限推导关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FHoDTT}\\vdash J\">\\(\\mathrm{FHoDTT}\\vdash J\\)</span>。固定良构 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in\\{\\mathsf{Type},\\mathsf{Kind}\\}\">\\(s\\in\\{\\mathsf{Type},\\mathsf{Kind}\\}\\)</span>。下节使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"25a281534aa42440\" href=\"?note=25a281534aa42440\" title=\"16-df-category\">16-df-category</a> 的六元组编码构造 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T_\\Gamma,\\mathcal K_\\Gamma\">\\(\\mathcal T_\\Gamma,\\mathcal K_\\Gamma\\)</span>；所有显示的绑定变量均对其所在上下文及其绑定域外的表达式新鲜；绑定名按 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span> 等同。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[M]_{C,D}\">\\([M]_{C,D}\\)</span> 表示转换类，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[M]:C\\to D\">\\([M]:C\\to D\\)</span> 则简写带源靶标签的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle C,D,[M]_{C,D}\\rangle\">\\(\\langle C,D,[M]_{C,D}\\rangle\\)</span>。对象、箭头、恒等和复合的记录均在 Assertion 给出。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash A:\\mathsf{Kind}\">\\(\\Gamma\\vdash A:\\mathsf{Kind}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash\\sigma,\\tau:\\mathsf{Type}\">\\(\\Gamma\\vdash\\sigma,\\tau:\\mathsf{Type}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\">\\(N\\)</span> 分别是下式两种箭头的代表，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[M]\">\\([M]\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[N]\">\\([N]\\)</span> 为带源靶标签的箭头；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_{1,\\sigma}\">\\(\\pi_{1,\\sigma}\\)</span> 按下式对任意良构上下文 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta\">\\(\\Delta\\)</span> 中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\mathsf{Type},\\mathsf{Kind})\">\\((\\mathsf{Type},\\mathsf{Kind})\\)</span>-和的项定义，不预设强 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\mathsf{Kind},\\mathsf{Type})\">\\((\\mathsf{Kind},\\mathsf{Type})\\)</span>-和的投影。箭头代表的一个额外变量可换为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\">\\(a\\)</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\">\\(z\\)</span>，但保持 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span> 中的变量；这种写法由下节带上下文的转换类公式统一到固定新鲜变量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>在函子性公式中，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\sigma\\to\\tau\">\\(f:\\sigma\\to\\tau\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g:\\tau\\to\\upsilon\">\\(g:\\tau\\to\\upsilon\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T_\\Gamma\">\\(\\mathcal T_\\Gamma\\)</span> 箭头，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k:A\\to B\">\\(k:A\\to B\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"l:B\\to C\">\\(l:B\\to C\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal K_\\Gamma\">\\(\\mathcal K_\\Gamma\\)</span> 箭头。普通函子记录及伴随采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"fc49efccd7348d66\" href=\"?note=fc49efccd7348d66\" title=\"16-df-functor\">16-df-functor</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"a88937ea87ff8530\" href=\"?note=a88937ea87ff8530\" title=\"16-df-adjoint-functors\">16-df-adjoint-functors</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_\\Gamma\\sigma,R_\\Gamma A\">\\(X_\\Gamma\\sigma,R_\\Gamma A\\)</span> 分别表示相应记录的对象分量，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_\\Gamma(f),R_\\Gamma(k)\">\\(X_\\Gamma(f),R_\\Gamma(k)\\)</span> 表示其箭头分量。在自然性公式中，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k&#39;:A&#39;\\to A\">\\(k&#39;:A&#39;\\to A\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m:R_\\Gamma A\\to\\sigma\">\\(m:R_\\Gamma A\\to\\sigma\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h:\\sigma\\to\\sigma&#39;\">\\(h:\\sigma\\to\\sigma&#39;\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n:A\\to X_\\Gamma\\sigma\">\\(n:A\\to X_\\Gamma\\sigma\\)</span> 具有显示的源靶。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nO_s&amp;\\coloneqq\\{C\\in\\mathsf{Expr}\\mid\\mathrm{FHoDTT}\\vdash(\\Gamma\\vdash C:s)\\},\\\\\n[M]_{C,D}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{N\\in\\mathsf{Expr}\\mid\n\\mathrm{FHoDTT}\\vdash(\\Gamma,x:C\\vdash M\\equiv N:D)\\},\\\\\nH_s(C,D)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle C,D,[M]_{C,D}\\rangle\\mid M\\in\\mathsf{Expr}\\land\n\\mathrm{FHoDTT}\\vdash(\\Gamma,x:C\\vdash M:D)\\}\\quad(C,D\\in O_s),\\\\\nM_s&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{C,D\\in O_s}H_s(C,D),\\\\\ns_s\\langle C,D,[M]_{C,D}\\rangle&amp;\\coloneqq C,\\qquad\nt_s\\langle C,D,[M]_{C,D}\\rangle\\coloneqq D,\\\\\n\\operatorname{id}^s_C&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle C,C,[x]_{C,C}\\rangle,\\\\\n\\langle D,E,[N]_{D,E}\\rangle\\circ_s\\langle C,D,[M]_{C,D}\\rangle\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle C,E,[N[M/x]]_{C,E}\\rangle,\\\\\ne_s(C)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{id}^s_C,\\qquad c_s(g,f)\\coloneqq g\\circ_s f,\\\\\n\\mathcal C^s_\\Gamma&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle O_s,M_s,s_s,t_s,e_s,c_s\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathcal T_\\Gamma&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathcal C^{\\mathsf{Type}}_\\Gamma,\\qquad\n\\mathcal K_\\Gamma\\coloneqq\\mathcal C^{\\mathsf{Kind}}_\\Gamma,\\\\\n[z:C\\vdash M:D]&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle C,D,[M[x/z]]_{C,D}\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Cat}(\\mathcal T_\\Gamma)&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Cat}(\\mathcal K_\\Gamma).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nO_s&amp;\\coloneqq\\{C\\in\\mathsf{Expr}\\mid\\mathrm{FHoDTT}\\vdash(\\Gamma\\vdash C:s)\\},\\\\\n[M]_{C,D}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{N\\in\\mathsf{Expr}\\mid\n\\mathrm{FHoDTT}\\vdash(\\Gamma,x:C\\vdash M\\equiv N:D)\\},\\\\\nH_s(C,D)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle C,D,[M]_{C,D}\\rangle\\mid M\\in\\mathsf{Expr}\\land\n\\mathrm{FHoDTT}\\vdash(\\Gamma,x:C\\vdash M:D)\\}\\quad(C,D\\in O_s),\\\\\nM_s&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{C,D\\in O_s}H_s(C,D),\\\\\ns_s\\langle C,D,[M]_{C,D}\\rangle&amp;\\coloneqq C,\\qquad\nt_s\\langle C,D,[M]_{C,D}\\rangle\\coloneqq D,\\\\\n\\operatorname{id}^s_C&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle C,C,[x]_{C,C}\\rangle,\\\\\n\\langle D,E,[N]_{D,E}\\rangle\\circ_s\\langle C,D,[M]_{C,D}\\rangle\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle C,E,[N[M/x]]_{C,E}\\rangle,\\\\\ne_s(C)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{id}^s_C,\\qquad c_s(g,f)\\coloneqq g\\circ_s f,\\\\\n\\mathcal C^s_\\Gamma&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle O_s,M_s,s_s,t_s,e_s,c_s\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathcal T_\\Gamma&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathcal C^{\\mathsf{Type}}_\\Gamma,\\qquad\n\\mathcal K_\\Gamma\\coloneqq\\mathcal C^{\\mathsf{Kind}}_\\Gamma,\\\\\n[z:C\\vdash M:D]&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle C,D,[M[x/z]]_{C,D}\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Cat}(\\mathcal T_\\Gamma)&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Cat}(\\mathcal K_\\Gamma).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;(\\forall C,D\\in O_s)(\\forall f\\in H_s(C,D))\\quad\nf\\circ_s\\operatorname{id}^s_C=f\\ \\land\\ \\operatorname{id}^s_D\\circ_s f=f,\\\\\n&amp;(\\forall C,D,E,F\\in O_s)(\\forall f\\in H_s(C,D))(\\forall g\\in H_s(D,E))(\\forall h\\in H_s(E,F))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{20mm}(h\\circ_s g)\\circ_s f=h\\circ_s(g\\circ_s f).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;(\\forall C,D\\in O_s)(\\forall f\\in H_s(C,D))\\quad\nf\\circ_s\\operatorname{id}^s_C=f\\ \\land\\ \\operatorname{id}^s_D\\circ_s f=f,\\\\\n&amp;(\\forall C,D,E,F\\in O_s)(\\forall f\\in H_s(C,D))(\\forall g\\in H_s(D,E))(\\forall h\\in H_s(E,F))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{20mm}(h\\circ_s g)\\circ_s f=h\\circ_s(g\\circ_s f).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(X_\\Gamma)_0(\\sigma)\\coloneqq\\Sigma^{\\mathsf{Type},\\mathsf{Kind}}(x:\\sigma).1_{\\mathsf{Kind}},\\qquad\n(R_\\Gamma)_0(A)\\coloneqq\\Sigma^{\\mathsf{Kind},\\mathsf{Type}}(a:A).1_{\\mathsf{Type}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(X_\\Gamma)_0(\\sigma)\\coloneqq\\Sigma^{\\mathsf{Type},\\mathsf{Kind}}(x:\\sigma).1_{\\mathsf{Kind}},\\qquad\n(R_\\Gamma)_0(A)\\coloneqq\\Sigma^{\\mathsf{Kind},\\mathsf{Type}}(a:A).1_{\\mathsf{Type}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\pi_{1,\\sigma}(N)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{split}^{\\mathsf{Type},\\mathsf{Kind},\\mathsf{Type}}_{\\sigma,x.1_{\\mathsf{Kind}},z.\\sigma}(N;x,w.x)\n\\quad(\\Delta\\vdash\\sigma:\\mathsf{Type},\\ \\Delta\\vdash N:\\Sigma^{\\mathsf{Type},\\mathsf{Kind}}(x:\\sigma).1_{\\mathsf{Kind}}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\pi_{1,\\sigma}(N)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{split}^{\\mathsf{Type},\\mathsf{Kind},\\mathsf{Type}}_{\\sigma,x.1_{\\mathsf{Kind}},z.\\sigma}(N;x,w.x)\n\\quad(\\Delta\\vdash\\sigma:\\mathsf{Type},\\ \\Delta\\vdash N:\\Sigma^{\\mathsf{Type},\\mathsf{Kind}}(x:\\sigma).1_{\\mathsf{Kind}}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n(X_\\Gamma)_1([x:\\sigma\\vdash M:\\tau])\n&amp;\\coloneqq[z:X_\\Gamma\\sigma\\vdash\n\\operatorname{split}^{\\mathsf{Type},\\mathsf{Kind},\\mathsf{Kind}}_{\\sigma,x.1_{\\mathsf{Kind}},z.X_\\Gamma\\tau}\n(z;x,w.\\operatorname{pair}^{\\mathsf{Type},\\mathsf{Kind}}_{\\tau,y.1_{\\mathsf{Kind}}}(M,w)):X_\\Gamma\\tau],\\\\\n(R_\\Gamma)_1([a:A\\vdash F:B])\n&amp;\\coloneqq[z:R_\\Gamma A\\vdash\n\\operatorname{split}^{\\mathsf{Kind},\\mathsf{Type},\\mathsf{Type}}_{A,a.1_{\\mathsf{Type}},z.R_\\Gamma B}\n(z;a,w.\\operatorname{pair}^{\\mathsf{Kind},\\mathsf{Type}}_{B,y.1_{\\mathsf{Type}}}(F,w)):R_\\Gamma B].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n(X_\\Gamma)_1([x:\\sigma\\vdash M:\\tau])\n&amp;\\coloneqq[z:X_\\Gamma\\sigma\\vdash\n\\operatorname{split}^{\\mathsf{Type},\\mathsf{Kind},\\mathsf{Kind}}_{\\sigma,x.1_{\\mathsf{Kind}},z.X_\\Gamma\\tau}\n(z;x,w.\\operatorname{pair}^{\\mathsf{Type},\\mathsf{Kind}}_{\\tau,y.1_{\\mathsf{Kind}}}(M,w)):X_\\Gamma\\tau],\\\\\n(R_\\Gamma)_1([a:A\\vdash F:B])\n&amp;\\coloneqq[z:R_\\Gamma A\\vdash\n\\operatorname{split}^{\\mathsf{Kind},\\mathsf{Type},\\mathsf{Type}}_{A,a.1_{\\mathsf{Type}},z.R_\\Gamma B}\n(z;a,w.\\operatorname{pair}^{\\mathsf{Kind},\\mathsf{Type}}_{B,y.1_{\\mathsf{Type}}}(F,w)):R_\\Gamma B].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nX_\\Gamma&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle(X_\\Gamma)_0,(X_\\Gamma)_1\\rangle,\\qquad\nR_\\Gamma\\coloneqq\\langle(R_\\Gamma)_0,(R_\\Gamma)_1\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Functor}(X_\\Gamma,\\mathcal T_\\Gamma,\\mathcal K_\\Gamma)&amp;\\land\n\\mathrm{Functor}(R_\\Gamma,\\mathcal K_\\Gamma,\\mathcal T_\\Gamma).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nX_\\Gamma&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle(X_\\Gamma)_0,(X_\\Gamma)_1\\rangle,\\qquad\nR_\\Gamma\\coloneqq\\langle(R_\\Gamma)_0,(R_\\Gamma)_1\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Functor}(X_\\Gamma,\\mathcal T_\\Gamma,\\mathcal K_\\Gamma)&amp;\\land\n\\mathrm{Functor}(R_\\Gamma,\\mathcal K_\\Gamma,\\mathcal T_\\Gamma).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\Phi_{A,\\sigma}:\\mathcal T_\\Gamma(R_\\Gamma A,\\sigma)\n&amp;\\to\\mathcal K_\\Gamma(A,X_\\Gamma\\sigma),\\\\\n\\Phi_{A,\\sigma}([z:R_\\Gamma A\\vdash M:\\sigma])&amp;\\coloneqq\n[a:A\\vdash\\operatorname{pair}^{\\mathsf{Type},\\mathsf{Kind}}_{\\sigma,x.1_{\\mathsf{Kind}}}\n\\bigl(M[\\operatorname{pair}^{\\mathsf{Kind},\\mathsf{Type}}_{A,y.1_{\\mathsf{Type}}}(a,()_{\\mathsf{Type}})/z],()_{\\mathsf{Kind}}\\bigr):X_\\Gamma\\sigma],\\\\\n\\Psi_{A,\\sigma}:\\mathcal K_\\Gamma(A,X_\\Gamma\\sigma)\n&amp;\\to\\mathcal T_\\Gamma(R_\\Gamma A,\\sigma),\\\\\n\\Psi_{A,\\sigma}([a:A\\vdash N:X_\\Gamma\\sigma])&amp;\\coloneqq\n[z:R_\\Gamma A\\vdash\\operatorname{split}^{\\mathsf{Kind},\\mathsf{Type},\\mathsf{Type}}_{A,a.1_{\\mathsf{Type}},z.\\sigma}\n(z;a,w.\\pi_{1,\\sigma}(N)):\\sigma].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\Phi_{A,\\sigma}:\\mathcal T_\\Gamma(R_\\Gamma A,\\sigma)\n&amp;\\to\\mathcal K_\\Gamma(A,X_\\Gamma\\sigma),\\\\\n\\Phi_{A,\\sigma}([z:R_\\Gamma A\\vdash M:\\sigma])&amp;\\coloneqq\n[a:A\\vdash\\operatorname{pair}^{\\mathsf{Type},\\mathsf{Kind}}_{\\sigma,x.1_{\\mathsf{Kind}}}\n\\bigl(M[\\operatorname{pair}^{\\mathsf{Kind},\\mathsf{Type}}_{A,y.1_{\\mathsf{Type}}}(a,()_{\\mathsf{Type}})/z],()_{\\mathsf{Kind}}\\bigr):X_\\Gamma\\sigma],\\\\\n\\Psi_{A,\\sigma}:\\mathcal K_\\Gamma(A,X_\\Gamma\\sigma)\n&amp;\\to\\mathcal T_\\Gamma(R_\\Gamma A,\\sigma),\\\\\n\\Psi_{A,\\sigma}([a:A\\vdash N:X_\\Gamma\\sigma])&amp;\\coloneqq\n[z:R_\\Gamma A\\vdash\\operatorname{split}^{\\mathsf{Kind},\\mathsf{Type},\\mathsf{Type}}_{A,a.1_{\\mathsf{Type}},z.\\sigma}\n(z;a,w.\\pi_{1,\\sigma}(N)):\\sigma].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nX_\\Gamma(1_\\sigma)&amp;=1_{X_\\Gamma\\sigma},&amp;\nX_\\Gamma(g\\circ f)&amp;=X_\\Gamma(g)\\circ X_\\Gamma(f),\\\\\nR_\\Gamma(1_A)&amp;=1_{R_\\Gamma A},&amp;\nR_\\Gamma(l\\circ k)&amp;=R_\\Gamma(l)\\circ R_\\Gamma(k),\\\\\n\\Phi_{A&#39;,\\sigma&#39;}(h\\circ m\\circ R_\\Gamma(k&#39;))\n&amp;=X_\\Gamma(h)\\circ\\Phi_{A,\\sigma}(m)\\circ k&#39;,\\\\\n\\Psi_{A&#39;,\\sigma&#39;}(X_\\Gamma(h)\\circ n\\circ k&#39;)\n&amp;=h\\circ\\Psi_{A,\\sigma}(n)\\circ R_\\Gamma(k&#39;).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nX_\\Gamma(1_\\sigma)&amp;=1_{X_\\Gamma\\sigma},&amp;\nX_\\Gamma(g\\circ f)&amp;=X_\\Gamma(g)\\circ X_\\Gamma(f),\\\\\nR_\\Gamma(1_A)&amp;=1_{R_\\Gamma A},&amp;\nR_\\Gamma(l\\circ k)&amp;=R_\\Gamma(l)\\circ R_\\Gamma(k),\\\\\n\\Phi_{A&#39;,\\sigma&#39;}(h\\circ m\\circ R_\\Gamma(k&#39;))\n&amp;=X_\\Gamma(h)\\circ\\Phi_{A,\\sigma}(m)\\circ k&#39;,\\\\\n\\Psi_{A&#39;,\\sigma&#39;}(X_\\Gamma(h)\\circ n\\circ k&#39;)\n&amp;=h\\circ\\Psi_{A,\\sigma}(n)\\circ R_\\Gamma(k&#39;).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\Phi&amp;\\coloneqq(\\Phi_{A,\\sigma})_{A\\in O_{\\mathsf{Kind}},\\sigma\\in O_{\\mathsf{Type}}},\\\\\n\\Psi_{A,\\sigma}\\circ\\Phi_{A,\\sigma}&amp;=\\operatorname{id}_{\\mathcal T_\\Gamma(R_\\Gamma A,\\sigma)},\\\\\n\\Phi_{A,\\sigma}\\circ\\Psi_{A,\\sigma}&amp;=\\operatorname{id}_{\\mathcal K_\\Gamma(A,X_\\Gamma\\sigma)},\\\\\n\\mathrm{AdjHom}(R_\\Gamma,X_\\Gamma,\\Phi)&amp;,\\qquad R_\\Gamma\\dashv X_\\Gamma,\\\\\n(X_\\Gamma)_1\\restriction\\mathcal T_\\Gamma(\\sigma,\\tau)&amp;:\n\\mathcal T_\\Gamma(\\sigma,\\tau)\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\n\\mathcal K_\\Gamma(X_\\Gamma\\sigma,X_\\Gamma\\tau).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\Phi&amp;\\coloneqq(\\Phi_{A,\\sigma})_{A\\in O_{\\mathsf{Kind}},\\sigma\\in O_{\\mathsf{Type}}},\\\\\n\\Psi_{A,\\sigma}\\circ\\Phi_{A,\\sigma}&amp;=\\operatorname{id}_{\\mathcal T_\\Gamma(R_\\Gamma A,\\sigma)},\\\\\n\\Phi_{A,\\sigma}\\circ\\Psi_{A,\\sigma}&amp;=\\operatorname{id}_{\\mathcal K_\\Gamma(A,X_\\Gamma\\sigma)},\\\\\n\\mathrm{AdjHom}(R_\\Gamma,X_\\Gamma,\\Phi)&amp;,\\qquad R_\\Gamma\\dashv X_\\Gamma,\\\\\n(X_\\Gamma)_1\\restriction\\mathcal T_\\Gamma(\\sigma,\\tau)&amp;:\n\\mathcal T_\\Gamma(\\sigma,\\tau)\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\n\\mathcal K_\\Gamma(X_\\Gamma\\sigma,X_\\Gamma\\tau).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>来源：Propositions 11.5.2–11.5.3，pp. 689–691（PDF 709–711）。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 将 type 嵌入 kind，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> 为左伴随；强 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\mathsf{Kind},\\mathsf{Type})\">\\((\\mathsf{Kind},\\mathsf{Type})\\)</span>-和的存在足够构造 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 的全忠实性使用很强 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\mathsf{Type},\\mathsf{Kind})\">\\((\\mathsf{Type},\\mathsf{Kind})\\)</span>-和。</li>\n<li>带标签箭头呈现中两个箭头的代表都使用同一个新鲜变量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N[M/x]\">\\(N[M/x]\\)</span> 把目标上下文 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma,x:D\">\\(\\Gamma,x:D\\)</span> 中的自由变量替换为源上下文 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma,x:C\">\\(\\Gamma,x:C\\)</span> 中的项 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span>，插入的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 不再递归替换，故显示的替换合成有正确绑定；替换结合律与变量替换给出三条范畴公理。等式合同保证商类与运算均不依赖代表元。两个复合恒等由 split 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta/\\eta\">\\(\\beta/\\eta\\)</span> 和单位转换取得。公式在转换类上定义，因此合同保证代表元无关；合成保持性、自然性及与上下文替换相容均由同一替换和转换规则计算。全忠实性来自 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\Gamma,x:\\sigma)\\cong(\\Gamma,z:X\\sigma)\">\\((\\Gamma,x:\\sigma)\\cong(\\Gamma,z:X\\sigma)\\)</span>，互逆为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\mapsto(x,()_{\\mathsf{Kind}})\">\\(x\\mapsto(x,()_{\\mathsf{Kind}})\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\\mapsto\\pi_{1,\\sigma}z\">\\(z\\mapsto\\pi_{1,\\sigma}z\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>新增理由：现有 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"17bdb224f449da45\" href=\"?note=17bdb224f449da45\" title=\"16-df-fibred-reflection\">16-df-fibred-reflection</a> 只给抽象反射接口；本节点内建书中由四种和与单位构造该接口的具体项映射，供重建语法与范畴模型的下一步对应使用。它不是 J05 的整体可靠性或完备性证明。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"25a281534aa42440","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-functor","status":"resolved","id":"fc49efccd7348d66","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-functor]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-adjoint-functors","status":"resolved","id":"a88937ea87ff8530","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-adjoint-functors]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-fhodtt-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"ca2d757f82798122","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-fhodtt-syntax]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-fhodtt-terms","status":"resolved","id":"3930e297a315728a","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-fhodtt-terms]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-fhodtt-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"ca2d757f82798122","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"采用 [[16-df-fhodtt-syntax]]、[[16-df-fhodtt-terms]] 的混合语境、表达式集 $\\mathsf{Expr}$ 与有限推导关系 $\\mathrm{FHoDTT}\\vdash J$。固定良构 $\\Gamma$；$s\\in\\{\\mathsf{Type},\\mathsf{Kind}\\}$。下节使用 [[16-df-category]] 的六元组编码构造 $\\mathcal T_\\Gamma,\\mathcal K_\\Gamma$；所有显示的绑定变量均对其所在上下文及其绑定域外的表达式新鲜；绑定名按 $\\alpha$ 等同。$[M]_{C,D}$ 表示转换类，$[M]:C\\to D$ 则简写带源靶标签的 $\\langle C,D,[M]_{C,D}\\rangle$。对象、箭头、恒等和复合的记录均在 Assertion 给出。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-fhodtt-terms","status":"resolved","id":"3930e297a315728a","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"采用 [[16-df-fhodtt-syntax]]、[[16-df-fhodtt-terms]] 的混合语境、表达式集 $\\mathsf{Expr}$ 与有限推导关系 $\\mathrm{FHoDTT}\\vdash J$。固定良构 $\\Gamma$；$s\\in\\{\\mathsf{Type},\\mathsf{Kind}\\}$。下节使用 [[16-df-category]] 的六元组编码构造 $\\mathcal T_\\Gamma,\\mathcal K_\\Gamma$；所有显示的绑定变量均对其所在上下文及其绑定域外的表达式新鲜；绑定名按 $\\alpha$ 等同。$[M]_{C,D}$ 表示转换类，$[M]:C\\to D$ 则简写带源靶标签的 $\\langle C,D,[M]_{C,D}\\rangle$。对象、箭头、恒等和复合的记录均在 Assertion 给出。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"25a281534aa42440","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"采用 [[16-df-fhodtt-syntax]]、[[16-df-fhodtt-terms]] 的混合语境、表达式集 $\\mathsf{Expr}$ 与有限推导关系 $\\mathrm{FHoDTT}\\vdash J$。固定良构 $\\Gamma$；$s\\in\\{\\mathsf{Type},\\mathsf{Kind}\\}$。下节使用 [[16-df-category]] 的六元组编码构造 $\\mathcal T_\\Gamma,\\mathcal K_\\Gamma$；所有显示的绑定变量均对其所在上下文及其绑定域外的表达式新鲜；绑定名按 $\\alpha$ 等同。$[M]_{C,D}$ 表示转换类，$[M]:C\\to D$ 则简写带源靶标签的 $\\langle C,D,[M]_{C,D}\\rangle$。对象、箭头、恒等和复合的记录均在 Assertion 给出。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-functor","status":"resolved","id":"fc49efccd7348d66","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"在函子性公式中，$f:\\sigma\\to\\tau$、$g:\\tau\\to\\upsilon$ 为 $\\mathcal T_\\Gamma$ 箭头，$k:A\\to B$、$l:B\\to C$ 为 $\\mathcal K_\\Gamma$ 箭头。普通函子记录及伴随采用 [[16-df-functor]]、[[16-df-adjoint-functors]]，$X_\\Gamma\\sigma,R_\\Gamma A$ 分别表示相应记录的对象分量，$X_\\Gamma(f),R_\\Gamma(k)$ 表示其箭头分量。在自然性公式中，$k':A'\\to A$、$m:R_\\Gamma A\\to\\sigma$、$h:\\sigma\\to\\sigma'$、$n:A\\to X_\\Gamma\\sigma$ 具有显示的源靶。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-adjoint-functors","status":"resolved","id":"a88937ea87ff8530","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"在函子性公式中，$f:\\sigma\\to\\tau$、$g:\\tau\\to\\upsilon$ 为 $\\mathcal T_\\Gamma$ 箭头，$k:A\\to B$、$l:B\\to C$ 为 $\\mathcal K_\\Gamma$ 箭头。普通函子记录及伴随采用 [[16-df-functor]]、[[16-df-adjoint-functors]]，$X_\\Gamma\\sigma,R_\\Gamma A$ 分别表示相应记录的对象分量，$X_\\Gamma(f),R_\\Gamma(k)$ 表示其箭头分量。在自然性公式中，$k':A'\\to A$、$m:R_\\Gamma A\\to\\sigma$、$h:\\sigma\\to\\sigma'$、$n:A\\to X_\\Gamma\\sigma$ 具有显示的源靶。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-fibred-reflection","status":"resolved","id":"17bdb224f449da45","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"新增理由：现有 [[16-df-fibred-reflection]] 只给抽象反射接口；本节点内建书中由四种和与单位构造该接口的具体项映射，供重建语法与范畴模型的下一步对应使用。它不是 J05 的整体可靠性或完备性证明。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathsf{Expr}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FHoDTT}\\vdash J","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"s\\in\\{\\mathsf{Type},\\mathsf{Kind}\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal T_\\Gamma,\\mathcal K_\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"[M]_{C,D}","display":false},{"tex":"[M]:C\\to D","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle C,D,[M]_{C,D}\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\vdash A:\\mathsf{Kind}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\vdash\\sigma,\\tau:\\mathsf{Type}","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"N","display":false},{"tex":"[M]","display":false},{"tex":"[N]","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_{1,\\sigma}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta","display":false},{"tex":"(\\mathsf{Type},\\mathsf{Kind})","display":false},{"tex":"(\\mathsf{Kind},\\mathsf{Type})","display":false},{"tex":"a","display":false},{"tex":"z","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"f:\\sigma\\to\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"g:\\tau\\to\\upsilon","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal T_\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"k:A\\to B","display":false},{"tex":"l:B\\to C","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal K_\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"X_\\Gamma\\sigma,R_\\Gamma A","display":false},{"tex":"X_\\Gamma(f),R_\\Gamma(k)","display":false},{"tex":"k':A'\\to A","display":false},{"tex":"m:R_\\Gamma A\\to\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"h:\\sigma\\to\\sigma'","display":false},{"tex":"n:A\\to X_\\Gamma\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nO_s&\\coloneqq\\{C\\in\\mathsf{Expr}\\mid\\mathrm{FHoDTT}\\vdash(\\Gamma\\vdash C:s)\\},\\\\\n[M]_{C,D}&\\coloneqq\\{N\\in\\mathsf{Expr}\\mid\n\\mathrm{FHoDTT}\\vdash(\\Gamma,x:C\\vdash M\\equiv N:D)\\},\\\\\nH_s(C,D)&\\coloneqq\\{\\langle C,D,[M]_{C,D}\\rangle\\mid M\\in\\mathsf{Expr}\\land\n\\mathrm{FHoDTT}\\vdash(\\Gamma,x:C\\vdash M:D)\\}\\quad(C,D\\in O_s),\\\\\nM_s&\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{C,D\\in O_s}H_s(C,D),\\\\\ns_s\\langle C,D,[M]_{C,D}\\rangle&\\coloneqq C,\\qquad\nt_s\\langle C,D,[M]_{C,D}\\rangle\\coloneqq D,\\\\\n\\operatorname{id}^s_C&\\coloneqq\\langle C,C,[x]_{C,C}\\rangle,\\\\\n\\langle D,E,[N]_{D,E}\\rangle\\circ_s\\langle C,D,[M]_{C,D}\\rangle\n&\\coloneqq\\langle C,E,[N[M/x]]_{C,E}\\rangle,\\\\\ne_s(C)&\\coloneqq\\operatorname{id}^s_C,\\qquad c_s(g,f)\\coloneqq g\\circ_s f,\\\\\n\\mathcal C^s_\\Gamma&\\coloneqq\\langle O_s,M_s,s_s,t_s,e_s,c_s\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathcal T_\\Gamma&\\coloneqq\\mathcal C^{\\mathsf{Type}}_\\Gamma,\\qquad\n\\mathcal K_\\Gamma\\coloneqq\\mathcal C^{\\mathsf{Kind}}_\\Gamma,\\\\\n[z:C\\vdash M:D]&\\coloneqq\\langle C,D,[M[x/z]]_{C,D}\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Cat}(\\mathcal T_\\Gamma)&\\land\\mathrm{Cat}(\\mathcal K_\\Gamma).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&(\\forall C,D\\in O_s)(\\forall f\\in H_s(C,D))\\quad\nf\\circ_s\\operatorname{id}^s_C=f\\ \\land\\ \\operatorname{id}^s_D\\circ_s f=f,\\\\\n&(\\forall C,D,E,F\\in O_s)(\\forall f\\in H_s(C,D))(\\forall g\\in H_s(D,E))(\\forall h\\in H_s(E,F))\\\\\n&\\hspace{20mm}(h\\circ_s g)\\circ_s f=h\\circ_s(g\\circ_s f).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"(X_\\Gamma)_0(\\sigma)\\coloneqq\\Sigma^{\\mathsf{Type},\\mathsf{Kind}}(x:\\sigma).1_{\\mathsf{Kind}},\\qquad\n(R_\\Gamma)_0(A)\\coloneqq\\Sigma^{\\mathsf{Kind},\\mathsf{Type}}(a:A).1_{\\mathsf{Type}}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\pi_{1,\\sigma}(N)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{split}^{\\mathsf{Type},\\mathsf{Kind},\\mathsf{Type}}_{\\sigma,x.1_{\\mathsf{Kind}},z.\\sigma}(N;x,w.x)\n\\quad(\\Delta\\vdash\\sigma:\\mathsf{Type},\\ \\Delta\\vdash N:\\Sigma^{\\mathsf{Type},\\mathsf{Kind}}(x:\\sigma).1_{\\mathsf{Kind}}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n(X_\\Gamma)_1([x:\\sigma\\vdash M:\\tau])\n&\\coloneqq[z:X_\\Gamma\\sigma\\vdash\n\\operatorname{split}^{\\mathsf{Type},\\mathsf{Kind},\\mathsf{Kind}}_{\\sigma,x.1_{\\mathsf{Kind}},z.X_\\Gamma\\tau}\n(z;x,w.\\operatorname{pair}^{\\mathsf{Type},\\mathsf{Kind}}_{\\tau,y.1_{\\mathsf{Kind}}}(M,w)):X_\\Gamma\\tau],\\\\\n(R_\\Gamma)_1([a:A\\vdash F:B])\n&\\coloneqq[z:R_\\Gamma A\\vdash\n\\operatorname{split}^{\\mathsf{Kind},\\mathsf{Type},\\mathsf{Type}}_{A,a.1_{\\mathsf{Type}},z.R_\\Gamma B}\n(z;a,w.\\operatorname{pair}^{\\mathsf{Kind},\\mathsf{Type}}_{B,y.1_{\\mathsf{Type}}}(F,w)):R_\\Gamma B].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nX_\\Gamma&\\coloneqq\\langle(X_\\Gamma)_0,(X_\\Gamma)_1\\rangle,\\qquad\nR_\\Gamma\\coloneqq\\langle(R_\\Gamma)_0,(R_\\Gamma)_1\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Functor}(X_\\Gamma,\\mathcal T_\\Gamma,\\mathcal K_\\Gamma)&\\land\n\\mathrm{Functor}(R_\\Gamma,\\mathcal K_\\Gamma,\\mathcal T_\\Gamma).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\Phi_{A,\\sigma}:\\mathcal T_\\Gamma(R_\\Gamma A,\\sigma)\n&\\to\\mathcal K_\\Gamma(A,X_\\Gamma\\sigma),\\\\\n\\Phi_{A,\\sigma}([z:R_\\Gamma A\\vdash M:\\sigma])&\\coloneqq\n[a:A\\vdash\\operatorname{pair}^{\\mathsf{Type},\\mathsf{Kind}}_{\\sigma,x.1_{\\mathsf{Kind}}}\n\\bigl(M[\\operatorname{pair}^{\\mathsf{Kind},\\mathsf{Type}}_{A,y.1_{\\mathsf{Type}}}(a,()_{\\mathsf{Type}})/z],()_{\\mathsf{Kind}}\\bigr):X_\\Gamma\\sigma],\\\\\n\\Psi_{A,\\sigma}:\\mathcal K_\\Gamma(A,X_\\Gamma\\sigma)\n&\\to\\mathcal T_\\Gamma(R_\\Gamma A,\\sigma),\\\\\n\\Psi_{A,\\sigma}([a:A\\vdash N:X_\\Gamma\\sigma])&\\coloneqq\n[z:R_\\Gamma A\\vdash\\operatorname{split}^{\\mathsf{Kind},\\mathsf{Type},\\mathsf{Type}}_{A,a.1_{\\mathsf{Type}},z.\\sigma}\n(z;a,w.\\pi_{1,\\sigma}(N)):\\sigma].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nX_\\Gamma(1_\\sigma)&=1_{X_\\Gamma\\sigma},&\nX_\\Gamma(g\\circ f)&=X_\\Gamma(g)\\circ X_\\Gamma(f),\\\\\nR_\\Gamma(1_A)&=1_{R_\\Gamma A},&\nR_\\Gamma(l\\circ k)&=R_\\Gamma(l)\\circ R_\\Gamma(k),\\\\\n\\Phi_{A',\\sigma'}(h\\circ m\\circ R_\\Gamma(k'))\n&=X_\\Gamma(h)\\circ\\Phi_{A,\\sigma}(m)\\circ k',\\\\\n\\Psi_{A',\\sigma'}(X_\\Gamma(h)\\circ n\\circ k')\n&=h\\circ\\Psi_{A,\\sigma}(n)\\circ R_\\Gamma(k').\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\Phi&\\coloneqq(\\Phi_{A,\\sigma})_{A\\in O_{\\mathsf{Kind}},\\sigma\\in O_{\\mathsf{Type}}},\\\\\n\\Psi_{A,\\sigma}\\circ\\Phi_{A,\\sigma}&=\\operatorname{id}_{\\mathcal T_\\Gamma(R_\\Gamma A,\\sigma)},\\\\\n\\Phi_{A,\\sigma}\\circ\\Psi_{A,\\sigma}&=\\operatorname{id}_{\\mathcal K_\\Gamma(A,X_\\Gamma\\sigma)},\\\\\n\\mathrm{AdjHom}(R_\\Gamma,X_\\Gamma,\\Phi)&,\\qquad R_\\Gamma\\dashv X_\\Gamma,\\\\\n(X_\\Gamma)_1\\restriction\\mathcal T_\\Gamma(\\sigma,\\tau)&:\n\\mathcal T_\\Gamma(\\sigma,\\tau)\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\n\\mathcal K_\\Gamma(X_\\Gamma\\sigma,X_\\Gamma\\tau).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"R","display":false},{"tex":"(\\mathsf{Kind},\\mathsf{Type})","display":false},{"tex":"R","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"(\\mathsf{Type},\\mathsf{Kind})","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"N[M/x]","display":fa